-- 費率與限時層（#188 第 2 層）：費率改版、限時分時段、時段性禁停、資格跟格位走、
-- 路段費率、移除分區 area。欄位：/tmp/motorcycle-parking-agent-comms/design-handoff/
-- T188_L2_FIELDS_20261101.md；契約 supabase/functions/_shared/parking_contract.json。
--
-- 1. parking_contract() and the generated sections of
--    supabase/contract/parking_contract.sql are copied below:
--    - fee: not_applicable (no bays for that vehicle); hourly loses
--      free_minutes and unit_minutes; per_visit loses max_minutes and the
--      extension object for extension_amount; a heavy follow loses
--      factor_pct; daily and posted are no longer stored (step 4 converts
--      them). fee_note_of() leaves a not_applicable vehicle out and writes
--      延長每次 N 元. fee_write_complete() / fee_rate_write_complete() hold
--      new writes to renew, a cap's cap_reset and cross_period (fee.write).
--    - condition.limits: time_limit takes periods [{days, from?, to?,
--      max_minutes, extensions}] (the old top-level max_minutes or no key
--      stays readable); no_parking {periods: [{days, from?, to?}]} is new.
--      condition_write_complete() holds new writes to the periods.
--    - segments may carry allow, fee and fee_plan (valid_segments(),
--      valid_segment_fee_plans()); zones lose area (valid_zones()).
-- 2. Zones lose area: a trigger drops it from every write (old builds still
--    send it; PM_ANS_20261101_49: dropped, not refused, until the minimum
--    supported app is past this layer), and step 4 drops it from the rows.
--    Zone ids are matched by name alone.
-- 3. Segments: only street spots have them (a check); a segment's fee_plan
--    is a copy of its plan like a zone's (fee_plans_sync() keeps the plans
--    segments refer to and counts them when a plan in use is removed).
-- 4. Data: every stored fee (spot, plans, zones) and pending suggestion is
--    upgraded by fee_upgrade(): daily → per_visit with renew midnight
--    (calendar_day; per_entry → none; rolling_24h: renew left out), posted
--    → the vehicle left out, free_minutes / unit_minutes / factor_pct /
--    max_minutes dropped, extension → extension_amount. A fee_note that was
--    the old sentence of its fee is rewritten. The per_visit max_minutes of
--    three official lots without zones (staging, 2026-11-01) has no
--    condition to move to: it is dropped and listed by NOTICE for review.
-- 5. Eligibility goes with the bay: a trigger derives the spot-level
--    scooter/heavy flags from its entries (lots: zones, street: segments):
--    any entry true → true; otherwise, when the list is complete (a
--    street spot's segments, a lot with zones_complete) and every entry
--    states the vehicle, not_stated if one says so, else false; otherwise
--    the flags stay as written. A street spot with exactly one segment
--    gets the spot's flags on that segment (none on staging); one with more
--    is left for an admin to fill in (要補填).
-- 6. New helpers are revoked from public, anon and authenticated (#195 P0).

-- The rows whose fee_note is the old sentence of their fee, before
-- fee_note_of() changes: step 4 rewrites exactly those.
create temporary table t188_generated_notes as
  select 'community' t,id from public.community_spots
    where jsonb_typeof(fee)='object' and fee_note=public.fee_note_of(fee)
  union all
  select 'official',id from public.official_heavy_spots
    where jsonb_typeof(fee)='object' and fee_note=public.fee_note_of(fee);

